Values = PackedStringArray("ROSTER", "選擇角色", "[W]/[S] look", "[W]/[S] 瀏覽", "[E] take", "[E] 選定", "[C] back", "[C] 返回", "locked — {0} extractions", "未開放 — 需撤離 {0} 次", "{0} hp  {1} m/s  {2} bulk", "{0} 生命  {1} 米/秒  {2} 負重", "starts with {0}", "起始配備 {0}", "starts with nothing, and every price in the shop is set for that", "無起始配備，商店的每個定價都是照這個算的", "playing as {0}", "本次出擊 {0}", "{0} opens after {1} extractions", "{0} 需撤離 {1} 次才會開放", "characters from PROJECT LAST DAWN, based on \"Game Ready Low Poly", "角色出自 PROJECT LAST DAWN，改作自 DanlyVostok 的", "Tactical Character\" by DanlyVostok, CC BY 4.0 — modified", "「Game Ready Low Poly Tactical Character」，CC BY 4.0 授權", "ASSAULT", "突擊", "no edges, no gaps; everything the shop sells is priced for this one", "沒有短板也沒有破綻；商店賣的每一件都是照她定的價", "RECON / TECH", "偵察／技術", "carries half again as much and cannot take a hit", "多背一半的東西，也挨不起一下", "MELEE / BERSERKER", "近戰／狂戰", "holds ground; a blade already turning, and the floor is cold", "守得住地；刀已經在轉，腳下的地是冷的", "PSIONIC / BLADE", "靈能／刃", "the fastest thing on the map, and the easiest to kill", "場上跑得最快的，也是最好殺的", "SUPPORT / MEDIC", "支援／醫療", "closes its own wounds, and the crowd bleeds for touching it", "自己會癒合，碰到她的人會流血", "1 blade", "旋刃 1", "{0} blades", "旋刃 {0}", "chill {0}", "冰緩 {0}", "loot x{0}", "戰利品 x{0}", "reach +{0} m", "搜刮範圍 +{0} 米", "dodge {0}", "閃避 {0}", "thorns {0}", "荊棘 {0}", "regen {0}/s", "回復 {0}/秒")
